2026-10-21 Manuel Lorente Rodriguez <ma8310lo-s@student.lu.se>
	Data derived script for shunshie and dependencies

	* Added bash script to obtain derived data for sunshie intensity and process raw data to derived. 
	* Added dependency to read CSV files in CPP. 

2026-10-22 Manuel Lorente Rodriguez <ma8310lo-s@student.lu.se>
	Data import in to CPP code.

	* Added parse_csv.h and parse_csv.cxx functionality to import cleaned CSV datasets with 3 or 4 columns.
	* Added functions to convert dates into day-of-year (1–366) and hours into integers (0–23)
	* Updated sunshine_derived.sh to make data separation with `,`.
	* Reorganized data processing scripts into scripts/data/ 
	* Updated READMEs for datasets folder and main project. 

2026-10-25 Manuel Lorente Rodriguez <ma8310lo-s@student.lu.se>
	Data analysis for solar irradiance. 

	* Added include/sunshine.h and src/sunshine.cxx with functionallity to analyze the quality of the data. 
	* Added inside sunshine implementation a preliminar plotting function to compare and analyze the data. 

2026-10-26 Manuel Lorente Rodriguez <ma8310lo-s@student.lu.se>
	Reorganized and simplified solar irradiance calculations and added three plotting functions.

	* Modified include/sunshine.h and src/sunshine.cxx to simplify the daily and yearly average calculations by reusing the sunshineByYearAndDay function.
	* Created include/sunshine_plot.h and src/sunshine_plot.cxx to separate data processing from ROOT visualization.
	* Implemented three plotting functions:
		* Daily solar irradiation comparison between Lund and Umeå, showing their average.
		* Daily solar irradiation histogram showing the average with individual years displayed as transparent curves in the background.
		* Annual mean solar irradiance comparison between Lund and Umeå, including linear regression fits.